# Walkthrough: Full Codebase Audit

I have conducted a comprehensive audit of the Academic Life OS codebase. This walkthrough summarizes the steps taken and the artifacts produced.

## Audit Process

1.  **Documentation Review:** Read all core and detailed documentation ([README.md](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/README.md), [CLAUDE.md](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/CLAUDE.md), [ARCHITECTURE.md](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/docs/ARCHITECTURE.md), [DATA_SCHEMA.md](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/docs/DATA_SCHEMA.md), [INTEGRATIONS.md](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/docs/INTEGRATIONS.md), [AI_LAYER.md](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/docs/AI_LAYER.md), [BUILD_PLAN.md](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/docs/BUILD_PLAN.md)) to understand the system's design and current status.
2.  **Backend Structure Analysis:** Explored the `backend/` directory, reviewing [main.py](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/backend/main.py), [database.py](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/backend/database.py), and various routers and services.
3.  **Core Service Audit:** Conducted a deep dive into [canvas_sync.py](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/backend/services/canvas_sync.py) and [ai_service.py](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/backend/services/ai_service.py) to evaluate complex logic and integration patterns.
4.  **Frontend Assessment:** Reviewed [package.json](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/frontend/package.json), project structure, and complex UI components like [AgendaTimeline.tsx](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/frontend/components/dashboard/AgendaTimeline.tsx).
5.  **Technical Debt Identification:** Highlighted potential risks such as AI service complexity and unusual dependency versions.

## Key Artifacts Produced

- [audit_report.md](file:///Users/oli/.gemini/antigravity/brain/22204202-b11e-493a-9252-4a554153d648/audit_report.md): The main deliverable containing all findings and recommendations.
- [task.md](file:///Users/oli/.gemini/antigravity/brain/22204202-b11e-493a-9252-4a554153d648/task.md): Tracking of audit tasks and completion status.

## Identified Highlights

- **Robust Integrations:** The Canvas sync and AI routing (Gemini + Ollama) are sophisticated and well-implemented.
- **Design Consistency:** The frontend strictly follows the "Glassmorphism" design system.
- **Complexity Management:** While the system is complex, the use of modular services and background tasks keeps it maintainable.
- **Known Issues:** Phase 2 (Timetable) has documented ICS timezone and recurrence issues that are being addressed.

The audit is now complete. Please refer to the [Full Audit Report](file:///Users/oli/.gemini/antigravity/brain/22204202-b11e-493a-9252-4a554153d648/audit_report.md) for detailed findings.
